# TradeTrack-Pro Environment Configuration
# Backend API URL for Render deployment

# 🔗 Render Backend URL
# Format: https://YOUR-SERVICE-NAME.onrender.com
# Based on your render.yaml, the service name is 'tradetrack-backend'
VITE_API_URL=https://tradetrack-backend.onrender.com

# ⚠️ IMPORTANT: 
# If your Render service has a different URL, please update the above line.
# You can find your actual URL in the Render Dashboard:
# https://dashboard.render.com → Select your service → Copy the URL

# 💡 For local development (connecting to localhost:5000):
# Comment out or remove the VITE_API_URL line above
# The vite.config.ts proxy will automatically redirect to localhost:5000
